			<item>
				<title>Das Paula-Becker-Modersohn-Haus in Bremen</title>
				<link>https://backsteinexpressionismus.projektemacher.org/en/post/das-paula-becker-modersohn-haus-in-bremen/manifest.json</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2020 18:29:07 +0200</pubDate><author>mail@christianmahnke.de (Christian Mahnke)</author>
				<guid>https://backsteinexpressionismus.projektemacher.org/en/post/das-paula-becker-modersohn-haus-in-bremen/manifest.json</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;If you grow up near Bremerhaven, another encounter with Brick Expressionism is unavoidable when your parents take you on an outing to the nearest larger city: the &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;        &lt;a data-wikidata-entity=&#34;Q531367&#34; href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/B%C3%B6ttcherstra%C3%9Fe&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Böttcherstrasse in Bremen&lt;/a&gt;.&#xA;Its effect on me at the time was rather negative, it was dark, convoluted and perhaps therefore a little menacing.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
